  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: 1st number **×** (1st number** ****÷ **2)** + 5** = 2nd number.\n\nNow,\n\nFor, 14 : 103\n\n⇒ 14 × (14 ÷ 2) + 5 \n\n⇒ 14 × 7 + 5 \n\n⇒ 98 + 5 = 103.\n\nFor, 18 : 167\n\n⇒ 18 × (18 ÷ 2) + 5 \n\n⇒ 18 × 9 + 5 \n\n⇒ 162 + 5 = 167.\n\nSimilarly, for **16 : ?**\n\n**⇒ 16 × (16 ÷ 2) + 5 **\n\n**⇒ 16 × 8 + 5 **\n\n**⇒ 128 + 5 = 133.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
